  "title": "Carter Bankshares, Inc. Announces First Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "MARTINSVILLE, VA / ACCESS Newswire / April 23, 2026 / Carter Bankshares, Inc. (the \"Company\") (NASDAQ:CARE), the holding company of Carter Bank (the \"Bank\") today announced quarterly net income of $85.8 million, or $3.88 diluted earnings per share (\"EPS\"), for the first quarter of 2026 compared to net income of $8.5 million, or $0.38 diluted EPS, for the fourth quarter of 2025 and net income of $9.0 million, or $0.39 diluted EPS, for the first quarter of 2025. Net interest income was $35.9 milli",
